        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DESERTED MEDIEVAL VILLAGES:\n  Wharram Percy (Yorkshire, UK): most excavated DMV\n    Excavated 40+ years (Beresford and Hurst)\n    → 12 longhouses + church + manor; peaked at ~40 families\n    → Abandoned c. 1500 as sheep farming replaced grain\n    → Bioarchaeology: population health, diet, disease from skeletons"
    },
    {
