      "text": "```\nCASTLE CONSTRUCTION SEQUENCE:\n  Norman motte-and-bailey (post-1066 in England):\n    Motte: earthen mound with timber tower\n    Bailey: enclosed courtyard below\n    Quick to build; earth + timber\n    → Replaced by stone in 12th c. as permanence required"
    },
