      "text": "LATER CASTLES (12th–15th c.):\n    Concentric design: multiple rings of walls\n    Cylindrical towers (better angle of fire)\n    Gatehouse towers\n    Water defenses: moats, wet ditches\n    Edward I's Welsh castles: Caernarfon, Conwy, Harlech\n    → Military engineering at state scale; financed by royal government"
    },
